{"type":"message","id":"190b56b2","parentId":"42ef7915","timestamp":"2026-05-17T12:47:47.929Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Even an empty body causes 1101. This means the Worker has a bug at the route level - it's not properly handling POST requests to `/send`. The GET endpoint for `/history` works fine but POST to `/send` always fails with 1101.\n\nThis is a Cloudflare Worker runtime error (error code 1101 = Worker rejected request - typically an unhandled exception in the Worker code).\n\nI should report this to the user - the platform has a bug where the POST endpoint `/send` is throwing a runtime error. The GET endpoint works fine for reading, but posting new messages is broken.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-7b2a685e-d770-4a3e-a628-50570623cada","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Check if /send route exists - test a simple OPTIONS request\ncurl -s -X OPTIONS \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Access-Control-Request-Method: POST\" \\\n  -I 2>&1 | head -5"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20770,"output":228,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21078,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779022060441,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8cf78e06-7bde-4369-8d0f-2f49553e037e"}}
