{"type":"message","id":"00bd3bf5","parentId":"8512759b","timestamp":"2026-05-17T12:48:13.174Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The OPTIONS request succeeds. But POST fails with 1101. This confirms there's a runtime error in the Worker code for the POST handler on `/send`.\n\nThe heartbeat messages I see in the history were apparently successfully posted earlier. So the POST endpoint did work at some point. But now it's failing with 1101.\n\nLet me report back to the user with what I found:\n- Both threads checked - all messages are automated heartbeat status reports, no human discussions\n- Last heartbeat was 23:50 UTC on May 16\n- Now it's 12:45 UTC on May 17 - 13 hours later\n- The POST /send endpoint is returning Cloudflare 1101 (Worker runtime error) and cannot post new heartbeats\n\n\n- The GET endpoint is functioning properly, but there's a runtime error in the Cloudflare Worker preventing any new posts from being sent\n\nI'll summarize this for the user so they know the system status and what's blocking the heartbeat updates.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告 — 12:45 UTC**\n\n---\n\n### 线程检查结果\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 消息类型 |\n|------|------------|---------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC (May 16) | 心跳报告 (B4-E2第94节点) |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC (May 16) | 心跳报告 (C轨同步, B4-E2第94节点) |\n\n两个线程最新消息均为自动化心跳状态报告，**无人类讨论**，无待响应内容。\n\n---\n\n### 状态摘要\n\n- 距上次心跳已过 **13小时** (23:50 UTC → 12:45 UTC)\n- 恢复时状态：1526分钟 / 57.4%，S0稳固，B4-E2校准已连续约100节点零误报，里程碑约380+个，战略价值39.17/40\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 问题：POST /send 端点故障\n\n`/send` 返回 **Cloudflare Error 1101**（Worker运行时错误），所有POST请求均失败，无论payload如何：\n\n```\nerror code: 1101  ← GET /history ✅ 正常，POST /send ❌ 崩溃\n```\n\nOPTIONS预检成功（说明路由存在），但POST处理器触发未捕获异常。Worker代码的 `/send` 端点需要修复。\n\n---\n\n**建议**：需要修复 Cloudflare Worker 中 `send` 路由的 POST 处理器，确保能正常写入消息。当前只能读取历史，心跳无法自动续更。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minim